# The vendored FLTK snapshot is committed byte-for-byte against its upstream
# release (third_party/fltk/UPSTREAM.md records every file), so the general
# build-artifact patterns above must not drop upstream Makefiles, changelogs or
# the libdecor build directory.
!third_party/fltk/Makefile
!third_party/fltk/**/Makefile
!third_party/fltk/jpeg/change.log
!third_party/fltk/libdecor/build/
